  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NHO International Cooperation Agreement 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A programme that aims to strengthen Employers&apos; Organisations in Colombia, Ethiopia, Ghana, Jordan, Kenya, Tanzania, Tunisia, Uganda, and Vietnam, using technical support from the Confederation of Norwegian Enterprise (NHO). The program contributes to gender equality (SDG 5) by promoting increased participation and equal opportunities for women in the labor market. Gender considerations are integrated into private sector development efforts, with targeted initiatives to enhance women&apos;s economic participation in partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
